stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> OPEN
  OPEN --> CLOCK_VALID: acquire local / disciplined timing
  CLOCK_VALID --> START: timing and required relationship valid
  START --> PREFILL: grant and data accepted
  PREFILL --> RUNNING: safe occupancy reached
  RUNNING --> HOLDOVER: reference lost, holdover valid
  HOLDOVER --> RUNNING: reference restored within bounds
  RUNNING --> MUTE_ABORT: invalid timing, exhausted holdover, or playout gap
  HOLDOVER --> MUTE_ABORT: safe bound expires
  MUTE_ABORT --> RECOVERY: local protection, fresh session required
  RECOVERY --> OPEN: session reopened
